          <coordinates>-78.2869,38.5707,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Big Meadows Lodge</name>
        <description>大草原景觀區與 Spottswood 餐廳</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-78.4367,38.5181,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
    <Folder>
      <name>🌲 Day 4-6 鐘乳石洞, 賓州農莊與五指湖</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Luray Caverns (盧雷鐘乳石洞)</name>
        <description>美東規模最大鐘乳石地底奇觀與地下管風琴</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-78.4839,38.6644,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Gettysburg National Military Park</name>
        <description>蓋提斯堡南北戰爭歷史紀念國家公園</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-77.2312,39.8142,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>The Amish Farm and House</name>
        <description>蘭開斯特阿米什傳統農莊體驗與馬車體驗</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-76.2163,40.0275,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Shady Maple Smorgasbord</name>
        <description>全美最大美式自助餐美食饗宴</description>
